WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Safex

00:00:07.741 --> 00:00:09.333
Candy!

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:12.441
Terry!

00:00:14.281 --> 00:00:19.078
After their short reunion...

00:00:19.328 --> 00:00:21.413
Candy and Terry...

00:00:21.563 --> 00:00:25.185
...have separated again reluctantly.

00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:32.159
Faceless Terrius

00:00:44.578 --> 00:00:45.671
Thank you!

00:00:45.821 --> 00:00:47.236
Let's go!

00:00:54.354 --> 00:00:56.584
The evening class has already started!

00:00:57.758 --> 00:00:59.551
A normal bullet wound

00:00:59.701 --> 00:01:02.788
is likely to recover fast
if the bullet has passed through the body.

00:01:02.938 --> 00:01:04.623
If the bullet stays inside,

00:01:04.773 --> 00:01:07.626
an operation must be performed
immediately.

00:01:07.776 --> 00:01:10.570
In this situation,
we need to watch out for...

00:01:12.439 --> 00:01:14.399
Who let you in?

00:01:14.549 --> 00:01:15.868
I am sorry.

00:01:16.018 --> 00:01:20.706
I won't accept any late student
in my class. Get out!

00:01:20.856 --> 00:01:22.307
It will not happen again!

00:01:22.457 --> 00:01:23.608
Again?

00:01:23.758 --> 00:01:27.112
We are dealing with human lives here!
Who do you think you are?!

00:01:27.362 --> 00:01:28.580
Get out!

00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:29.781
Yes!

00:01:32.559 --> 00:01:36.518
I can't do anything.
Teacher Bobson was right.

00:01:43.870 --> 00:01:46.264
The first aid for bullet wounds.

00:01:46.414 --> 00:01:48.300
War is coming.

00:01:48.450 --> 00:01:50.502
Is that why
we need to attend this class?

00:01:55.515 --> 00:01:58.276
We have a wounded patient
in Emergency.

00:01:58.426 --> 00:02:01.446
He fell from the train
and is seriously hurt. Please help!

00:02:01.596 --> 00:02:03.597
Prepare him for operation.

00:02:04.858 --> 00:02:06.348
Excuse me...

00:02:07.861 --> 00:02:10.188
Doctor, those trainee nurses...

00:02:10.338 --> 00:02:11.990
This is chance for them to learn.

00:02:12.140 --> 00:02:15.562
Give me two good trainees.

00:02:16.203 --> 00:02:17.329
Please...

00:02:17.571 --> 00:02:19.798
Franny and Natalie.

00:02:19.948 --> 00:02:21.733
Assist Doctor Bobson with his operation.

00:02:21.883 --> 00:02:22.667
Yes!

00:02:22.817 --> 00:02:25.233
As for the rest of you,
do some self-study.

00:02:26.213 --> 00:02:29.708
What are you doing? Go and study!

00:02:29.858 --> 00:02:31.114
Yes!

00:02:39.459 --> 00:02:41.359
Candy!

00:02:45.599 --> 00:02:48.329
No, it's impossible!

00:02:52.372 --> 00:02:54.499
I heard that Doctor Bobson's patient

00:02:54.649 --> 00:02:56.535
is an actor from the Stratford troupe.

00:02:59.412 --> 00:03:01.373
Stratford troupe?

00:03:01.523 --> 00:03:03.141
That's Terry's troupe!

00:03:03.291 --> 00:03:05.777
Judy, what is the name of the patient?

00:03:05.927 --> 00:03:09.386
Oh yes!
He seems to be a famous young actor.

00:03:09.656 --> 00:03:12.350
A famous young actor...

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:13.983
It can't be...

00:03:16.129 --> 00:03:17.562
Candy, where are you going?

00:03:42.088 --> 00:03:43.748
Natalie, what happened to you?

00:03:43.898 --> 00:03:46.189
Candy, can you look after Natalie?

00:03:46.426 --> 00:03:47.893
She is feeling a bit weak.

00:03:49.329 --> 00:03:51.694
Natalie, are you alright?

00:03:51.898 --> 00:03:53.728
Franny, the patient...

00:04:05.178 --> 00:04:07.677
How do you feel?

00:04:07.814 --> 00:04:09.008
Candy...

00:04:10.183 --> 00:04:11.510
Don't tell anyone

00:04:11.760 --> 00:04:14.447
I fainted in the operation room.

00:04:15.055 --> 00:04:17.582
I couldn't resist.

00:04:17.732 --> 00:04:20.455
Is it that serious?

00:04:21.528 --> 00:04:23.392
We might lose him.

00:04:28.301 --> 00:04:29.359
Candy!

00:04:32.572 --> 00:04:34.369
The operation is over.

00:04:34.741 --> 00:04:35.701
Wait!

00:04:35.851 --> 00:04:37.369
What's the matter with you?

00:04:37.519 --> 00:04:40.205
First, you skipped your night shift
and now you were late for class.

00:04:40.355 --> 00:04:41.473
That is because...

00:04:41.623 --> 00:04:42.874
Natalie is not any better.

00:04:43.024 --> 00:04:45.210
She faints when she sees blood.

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:46.611
How can she be a nurse?

00:04:46.761 --> 00:04:48.051
Sorry!

00:04:48.688 --> 00:04:50.849
Having students like you
in the Merry Jane Nurses School

00:04:50.999 --> 00:04:53.984
is a shame.

00:04:54.327 --> 00:04:57.956
Franny, why did you
vent your anger onto Natalie?

00:04:58.106 --> 00:05:02.504
Candy, don't waste time.
Go fill the name card for the patient.

00:05:02.794 --> 00:05:07.165
His name is Terrius.

00:05:23.656 --> 00:05:24.783
Terry!

00:05:24.933 --> 00:05:28.754
I didn't expect to write your name
in situation like this

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:45.143
Terry... Terry, I'm Candy.
Can you hear me?

00:05:48.882 --> 00:05:50.308
You heard me, right?

00:05:50.458 --> 00:05:53.375
Why did you so such a stupid thing?

00:05:55.355 --> 00:05:56.515
Terry.

00:05:56.756 --> 00:06:00.692
Did you jump off the train
for me, Terry ?

00:06:06.299 --> 00:06:07.994
Eliza!

00:06:08.868 --> 00:06:11.362
Step away from him.

00:06:11.512 --> 00:06:13.166
What do you mean?

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:19.070
The Leagans will be responsible
for Terry's care.

00:06:19.220 --> 00:06:20.737
Eliza's family?

00:06:21.314 --> 00:06:25.614
Shame on his colleagues!

00:06:25.785 --> 00:06:28.310
They didn't even show up
when Terry is injured like this.

00:06:29.255 --> 00:06:30.848
But don't worry, Terry.

00:06:30.998 --> 00:06:35.292
The troupe must be busy preparing
for the next show.

00:06:36.462 --> 00:06:40.358
You don't seem too happy
with me taking care of Terry.

00:06:40.708 --> 00:06:43.834
Terry should be the one
who is unhappy.

00:06:45.037 --> 00:06:46.527
What are you talking about?

00:06:52.078 --> 00:06:53.602
You better watch out!

00:06:58.217 --> 00:07:01.277
I am Candice White. Did you sent for me?

00:07:02.822 --> 00:07:04.153
Candice.

00:07:04.323 --> 00:07:09.253
Starting tomorrow, you will report
to Internal Medicine.

00:07:09.703 --> 00:07:12.656
But I am a surgery nurse...

00:07:12.806 --> 00:07:14.692
What is going on?

00:07:14.842 --> 00:07:17.127
You don't need to know the reason.

00:07:17.277 --> 00:07:19.663
This is the order from the principal.

00:07:19.813 --> 00:07:21.235
Principal?

00:07:25.077 --> 00:07:26.874
Eliza!

00:07:27.046 --> 00:07:29.105
Eliza must be behind this!

00:07:33.752 --> 00:07:35.946
Look after him with care.

00:07:36.096 --> 00:07:38.215
If anything happens to my Terry,

00:07:38.465 --> 00:07:39.987
you will be responsible.

00:07:40.426 --> 00:07:42.186
Natalie, can I cut here ?

00:07:42.336 --> 00:07:43.592
Ok.

00:07:45.364 --> 00:07:46.323
Listen!

00:07:46.473 --> 00:07:50.767
It's no big deal
to dismiss some trainee nurses.

00:07:51.003 --> 00:07:52.800
Understood, Miss Eliza.

00:07:53.855 --> 00:07:54.832
And another thing...

00:07:54.982 --> 00:07:57.842
I will not allow Candy
to come anywhere near this room.

00:07:58.210 --> 00:08:01.202
Yes, Miss Eliza.

00:08:03.882 --> 00:08:05.509
- What a witch!
- Indeed.

00:08:05.659 --> 00:08:08.178
Her father is a close friend
of the city's mayor.

00:08:08.353 --> 00:08:12.517
The principal listens
to whatever the mayor says.

00:08:26.939 --> 00:08:28.565
Terry.

00:08:28.715 --> 00:08:30.701
We are so close to each other.

00:08:30.851 --> 00:08:33.244
Yet, I can't take care of you.

00:08:48.393 --> 00:08:50.453
Nurse!

00:08:50.603 --> 00:08:51.818
Me?

00:08:52.263 --> 00:08:53.556
Yes, you.

00:08:53.906 --> 00:08:55.629
Can I help you?

00:08:57.936 --> 00:08:58.925
Candy!

00:08:59.604 --> 00:09:02.300
Do I know you?

00:09:02.707 --> 00:09:05.676
It is me, don't you remember me?

00:09:06.978 --> 00:09:08.443
Who are you?

00:09:11.082 --> 00:09:12.743
Stear!

00:09:14.085 --> 00:09:16.144
Why did you disguise like this?

00:09:17.088 --> 00:09:19.056
I don't want Eliza to see me.

00:09:20.325 --> 00:09:22.418
She won't come to the
Internal Medicine department.

00:09:22.761 --> 00:09:24.154
I am here for Terry...

00:09:24.304 --> 00:09:26.056
Terry is in this hospital
for the time being.

00:09:26.506 --> 00:09:27.724
Yesterday...

00:09:27.874 --> 00:09:31.057
Somebody saw Terry in another city.

00:09:31.536 --> 00:09:32.629
How is that possible?

00:09:32.779 --> 00:09:35.532
Terry fell from the train

00:09:35.682 --> 00:09:37.165
and he is now in this hospital.

00:09:37.408 --> 00:09:38.773
Did you see his face?

00:09:41.279 --> 00:09:43.179
This is weird.

00:09:45.216 --> 00:09:46.740
I can recall...

00:09:51.222 --> 00:09:53.789
His eyes were filled with fear.

00:09:54.626 --> 00:09:57.320
Candy, you should look into it.

00:09:57.470 --> 00:09:58.919
I will look into it.

00:09:59.464 --> 00:10:02.365
It would be fun, if he is not Terry.

00:10:03.935 --> 00:10:09.404
Because Eliza would be
taking care of a stranger.

00:10:13.011 --> 00:10:15.206
Candice, what are you doing there?

00:10:15.847 --> 00:10:19.409
This patient is lost.

00:10:19.559 --> 00:10:22.476
Hand the case to the doctor.

00:10:23.421 --> 00:10:26.182
Nurse, is it the end of the lobby?

00:10:26.332 --> 00:10:28.521
I got it. Thank you.

00:10:40.438 --> 00:10:42.030
Nurse.

00:10:43.341 --> 00:10:44.701
Can you change the flowers?

00:10:44.851 --> 00:10:46.970
But yesterday's flowers...

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:49.072
Flowers need to be changed every day.

00:10:49.222 --> 00:10:51.809
Terry, just ask if you need anything.

00:10:53.351 --> 00:10:56.382
Oh yeah, the curtain is horrible.

00:10:56.687 --> 00:10:59.415
Get it changed at once and then...

00:10:59.565 --> 00:11:02.218
Place another bed here tonight.

00:11:02.368 --> 00:11:04.120
In this room?

00:11:05.163 --> 00:11:07.457
I want to take care of Terry
for twenty-four hours a day.

00:11:07.607 --> 00:11:08.858
May I, Terry?

00:11:09.308 --> 00:11:10.962
Whatever...

00:11:14.705 --> 00:11:16.466
Eliza is staying here tonight?

00:11:16.616 --> 00:11:18.907
Candy,
I promised that patient something.

00:11:20.011 --> 00:11:23.941
He wants to see you
before Eliza shows up.

00:11:24.248 --> 00:11:27.410
Me? Did he mention my name?

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:30.880
Yes. Eliza will show up
in the evening.

00:11:31.789 --> 00:11:33.416
Thank you, Natalie.

00:11:49.040 --> 00:11:50.803
Just as expected.

00:11:54.579 --> 00:11:55.744
Candy!

00:11:56.747 --> 00:11:58.608
Don't you recognise my voice, Candy?

00:11:59.683 --> 00:12:02.278
I am Charlie, Terry's friend.

00:12:02.428 --> 00:12:03.843
Charlie?

00:12:04.088 --> 00:12:06.315
The guy from the wharf.

00:12:06.465 --> 00:12:07.687
Wharf?

00:12:18.336 --> 00:12:21.008
I remember, Sandra's friend.

00:12:21.872 --> 00:12:24.033
So you do remember.

00:12:25.209 --> 00:12:26.733
Charlie, why?

00:12:27.645 --> 00:12:30.353
I had to disguise as Terry.

00:12:30.503 --> 00:12:31.741
What happened to you?

00:12:31.891 --> 00:12:33.613
I escaped from prison.

00:12:34.452 --> 00:12:35.651
From where?

00:12:36.053 --> 00:12:40.922
A place where people like me
are locked up.

00:12:59.877 --> 00:13:01.174
Terry!

00:13:05.650 --> 00:13:06.844
Shit!

00:13:08.352 --> 00:13:09.683
He is there! Stop right there!

00:13:22.333 --> 00:13:23.630
Stop!

00:13:41.518 --> 00:13:43.612
When I was sent to this hospital,

00:13:43.762 --> 00:13:47.582
I used Terry's name.

00:13:47.732 --> 00:13:49.318
Someone will find out sooner or later.

00:13:49.768 --> 00:13:52.054
I will escape from here
before that happens.

00:13:52.204 --> 00:13:54.393
Charlie, this is not right.

00:13:54.865 --> 00:13:57.426
Candy, this is a decent hospital.

00:13:57.576 --> 00:13:59.759
If only that rich girl were not around.

00:14:00.309 --> 00:14:03.498
If Eliza finds out
that you are not Terry...

00:14:03.774 --> 00:14:05.639
She won't if I don't speak.

00:14:09.646 --> 00:14:10.813
Please leave.

00:14:11.681 --> 00:14:14.576
We have nurses
to attend to the special ward.

00:14:14.726 --> 00:14:16.380
There is no need for the family
to be here.

00:14:17.554 --> 00:14:19.214
Do you know who I am?

00:14:19.664 --> 00:14:20.749
Of course.

00:14:20.899 --> 00:14:25.124
You are the one
who is disturbing our nurses.

00:14:25.962 --> 00:14:29.691
What did you say?!
What is your name?

00:14:29.841 --> 00:14:31.495
Franny Hamilton.

00:14:32.635 --> 00:14:34.129
Franny Hamilton.

00:14:34.279 --> 00:14:36.672
I won't forget you! Let's go.

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:39.065
Franny was good.

00:15:09.539 --> 00:15:10.597
Candy?

00:15:14.611 --> 00:15:16.511
Is it you? I am alone here.

00:15:16.746 --> 00:15:18.106
He is not Terry.

00:15:18.256 --> 00:15:20.842
Candy! Isn't that you, Candy?

00:15:20.992 --> 00:15:23.311
The voice... It's somebody else!

00:15:23.461 --> 00:15:25.377
But he recognised Candy.

00:15:33.863 --> 00:15:35.592
- What happened, Charlie?
- Candy!

00:15:36.199 --> 00:15:37.560
Someone is in this room.

00:15:40.503 --> 00:15:42.630
Who is there? Come out!

00:15:45.541 --> 00:15:47.168
Eliza!

00:15:48.344 --> 00:15:51.004
Candy, who is this guy?

00:15:52.014 --> 00:15:52.974
Damn!

00:15:53.124 --> 00:15:54.710
Stop it, Charlie!

00:15:55.151 --> 00:15:58.484
So you are Charlie?
I will inform the principal.

00:16:01.424 --> 00:16:02.891
Wait, Eliza!

00:16:04.293 --> 00:16:05.419
Hold on!

00:16:09.198 --> 00:16:11.826
You know that impostor.

00:16:12.001 --> 00:16:14.862
He does not really want to be known.

00:16:15.012 --> 00:16:16.297
He...

00:16:16.447 --> 00:16:19.000
Anyway, he does not have
the same background as we do.

00:16:19.150 --> 00:16:21.543
Right, Candy?

00:16:22.478 --> 00:16:25.569
Did that impostor do anything wrong?

00:16:25.719 --> 00:16:28.309
No, he is here because...

00:16:29.719 --> 00:16:31.646
Candy, let's make a deal.

00:16:32.096 --> 00:16:33.080
A deal?

00:16:33.230 --> 00:16:35.216
If you leave Chicago,

00:16:35.366 --> 00:16:37.118
I will pretend
that I never seen anything.

00:16:37.268 --> 00:16:40.651
Leave Chicago? But the hospital...

00:16:40.996 --> 00:16:44.025
Yes, I want you to leave
this hospital

00:16:44.175 --> 00:16:47.862
I feel uncomfortable to see you
always around.

00:16:48.012 --> 00:16:51.771
Are you serious? I won't do it!

00:16:51.941 --> 00:16:53.670
I always wanted to be a nurse...

00:16:54.844 --> 00:16:57.039
Whatever...

00:16:58.380 --> 00:17:01.042
Think about it before dawn.

00:17:15.798 --> 00:17:16.897
Charlie!

00:17:18.434 --> 00:17:19.540
Charlie!

00:17:19.790 --> 00:17:22.630
She might call the police
or something.

00:17:22.780 --> 00:17:24.632
She won't. Charlie

00:17:24.782 --> 00:17:27.540
Go back to bed
or your wounds might open again.

00:17:28.043 --> 00:17:29.772
Wait, Candy!

00:17:31.614 --> 00:17:33.822
Can I trust you?

00:17:40.156 --> 00:17:42.021
It's getting interesting.

00:17:42.691 --> 00:17:46.723
That impostor does not want
the police to know he is not Terry...

00:17:48.030 --> 00:17:49.964
Mark, go to the police station.

00:17:50.633 --> 00:17:53.527
Candy, it is late now,
go back to your room.

00:17:53.677 --> 00:17:55.796
You don't have to worry about me.

00:17:55.946 --> 00:17:58.738
You need to get yourself healed.

00:17:59.808 --> 00:18:03.141
You are a nurse now.

00:18:04.713 --> 00:18:06.578
No, I still have a lot to learn.

00:18:06.815 --> 00:18:09.807
You are a nurse, Terry is an actor.

00:18:10.252 --> 00:18:12.948
But me...

00:18:13.552 --> 00:18:15.620
Terry and I have just started.

00:18:16.025 --> 00:18:17.356
You can too.

00:18:18.827 --> 00:18:21.188
I know what I am supposed to do.

00:18:21.838 --> 00:18:23.060
Yes?

00:18:23.705 --> 00:18:26.660
That's why I escaped from prison.

00:18:26.810 --> 00:18:29.169
What do you want to do?

00:18:31.273 --> 00:18:32.831
Join the army.

00:18:33.275 --> 00:18:34.606
The army?

00:18:39.281 --> 00:18:40.656
Charlie...

00:18:40.806 --> 00:18:44.047
I think you know that
war has already started in Europe.

00:18:44.920 --> 00:18:48.115
America will join the war
sooner or later.

00:18:48.265 --> 00:18:50.916
America?

00:18:57.766 --> 00:19:00.894
I will serve my country.

00:19:01.244 --> 00:19:02.530
Why?

00:19:05.207 --> 00:19:10.042
I have been stealing since I was young.

00:19:10.545 --> 00:19:12.740
I did bad things.

00:19:13.048 --> 00:19:16.279
I bullied the weaker.

00:19:18.420 --> 00:19:22.683
I am not trying to make up
for what I have done.

00:19:22.833 --> 00:19:25.152
I just want to protect
the vulnerable.

00:19:25.302 --> 00:19:28.754
I will not let them sacrifice in the war.

00:19:29.397 --> 00:19:31.695
Charlie, turn yourself in.

00:19:31.900 --> 00:19:34.460
Turn myself in? Are you kidding?

00:19:34.703 --> 00:19:37.197
I don't know when I will come out
if I am caught this time.

00:19:37.347 --> 00:19:39.502
I need to join the army
as soon as possible.

00:19:45.013 --> 00:19:46.344
That is him.

00:19:48.416 --> 00:19:50.316
- Charlie!
- Charlie Sanders.

00:19:50.585 --> 00:19:52.314
No, get off me!

00:19:52.721 --> 00:19:54.114
- Come with us!
- Charlie!

00:19:54.264 --> 00:19:55.747
You lied to me!

00:19:55.957 --> 00:19:58.251
- No!
- You lied to me!

00:19:58.401 --> 00:20:00.287
No, I didn't lie to you!

00:20:00.437 --> 00:20:01.886
Candy!

00:20:17.412 --> 00:20:19.312
Were you looking for me?

00:20:19.581 --> 00:20:21.378
- Come here.
- Yes.

00:20:23.919 --> 00:20:26.080
Sign here.

00:20:27.756 --> 00:20:29.951
An application to quit from study!

00:20:30.592 --> 00:20:33.320
Am I dismissed?

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:37.256
The police have asked
for your assistance.

00:20:37.406 --> 00:20:41.995
You might need to leave
the hospital if this gets big.

00:20:42.870 --> 00:20:43.863
Leave the hospital?

00:20:44.113 --> 00:20:48.334
There is evidence showing
that you have sheltered a criminal.

00:20:48.910 --> 00:20:52.307
Eliza, you never keep your word!

00:20:54.349 --> 00:20:55.873
Just sign it.

00:20:57.519 --> 00:21:00.886
Candy's future is in darkness.

00:21:01.223 --> 00:21:02.649
Because of these unexpected incidents,

00:21:02.799 --> 00:21:05.552
the frustrating journey
for Candy's nurse dream

00:21:05.702 --> 00:21:08.687
is set to face yet another crisis.
